      "content": "hey, so i just noticed something weird with my eye. like, i was just sitting on the couch and suddenly it felt like a bunch of little black dots or cobwebs were floating in my vision on the left side. it’s kinda annoying and making me feel a bit dizzy too. do u think it's just eye strain from my computer or something?",
