    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "an ER?? that seems like a lot for just some spots. im kinda scared to go in there and pay all those fees just to be told its nothing. is there like any way i can just tell if its serious at home? maybe some eye drops or something i can get at the drugstore to help the spots clear up?",
